ciModuleToMatrixFactorization -- transforms a module over a complete intersection of 2 quadrics into a matrix factorization
***************************************************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        (e1,e0) = ciModuleToMatrixFactorization M
  * Inputs:
      * M, a *note module: (Macaulay2Doc)Module,, module over a complete
        intersection of 2 quadrics
  * Outputs:
      * e1, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, 
      * e0, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, the matrix factorization, in
        the form needed for cliffordModule(e1,e0,R)

Description
===========

Part of the series of explicit functors giving category equivalences:

cliffordModule

cliffordModuleToCIResolution

cliffordModuleToMatrixFactorization

ciModuleToMatrixFactorization

ciModuleToCliffordModule

This function uses the bihomogeneous matrix factorization produced by the
script EisenbudShamashTotal in the package CompleteIntersectionResolutions.
Using the multigrading, a new matrix factorization in the form needed for
cliffordModule(e1,e0,R), where R=k[s,t].

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : setRandomSeed 0                                                         |
| -- setting random seed to 0                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = 0                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : n = 4                                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = 4                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : c = 2                                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = 2                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : kk = ZZ/101                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = kk                                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : QuotientRing                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : U = kk[x_0..x_(n-1)]                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = U                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : qq = matrix{{x_0^2+x_1^2,x_0*x_1}}                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = | x_0^2+x_1^2 x_0x_1 |                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|             1      2                                                        |
|o6 : Matrix U  <-- U                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : qq = random(U^1, U^{2:-2})                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = | 24x_0^2-36x_0x_1+19x_1^2-30x_0x_2+19x_1x_2-29x_2^2-29x_0x_3-10x_1x_3- |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     8x_2x_3-22x_3^2 -29x_0^2-24x_0x_1+39x_1^2-38x_0x_2+21x_1x_2+19x_2^2-16x_|
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     0x_3+34x_1x_3-47x_2x_3-39x_3^2 |                                        |
|                                                                             |
|             1      2                                                        |
|o7 : Matrix U  <-- U                                                         |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : Ubar = U/ideal qq                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o8 = Ubar                                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o8 : QuotientRing                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : M = coker vars Ubar                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o9 = cokernel | x_0 x_1 x_2 x_3 |                                            |
|                                                                             |
|                                  1                                          |
|o9 : Ubar-module, quotient of Ubar                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : betti (fM=freeResolution(M, LengthLimit => n))                         |
|                                                                             |
|             0 1 2  3  4                                                     |
|o10 = total: 1 4 8 12 16                                                     |
|          0: 1 4 8 12 16                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o10 : BettiTally                                                             |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : betti freeResolution(coker transpose fM.dd_3, LengthLimit => n)        |
|                                                                             |
|              0 1 2 3 4                                                      |
|o11 = total: 12 8 5 5 8                                                      |
|         -3: 12 8 4 1 .                                                      |
|         -2:  . . 1 4 8                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o11 : BettiTally                                                             |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i12 : (e1,e0) = ciModuleToMatrixFactorization M;                             |
