Check that it's a matrix factorization:

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i13 : source e0 == target e1                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o13 = true                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i14 : 0 == e0*e1 - diagonalMatrix(ring e0, apply(numcols e0, i->(e0*e1)_0_0))|
|                                                                             |
|o14 = true                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i15 : degrees source e1-degrees target e0                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o15 = {{3}, {3}, {3}, {3}, {3}, {3}, {3}, {3}}                               |
|                                                                             |
|o15 : List                                                                   |
