hyperellipticBranchEquation -- part of a CliffordModule
*******************************************************

  * Usage: 
        f = M.hyperellipticBranchEquation
  * Outputs:
      * f, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, 

Description
===========

Gives the branch equation of the set of points over which the associated
quadratic form is singular. It is same as the determinant of the symmetric
matrix M.symmetricM.

+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : setRandomSeed 0                                         |
| -- setting random seed to 0                                 |
|                                                             |
|o1 = 0                                                       |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : kk=ZZ/101;                                              |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : g=1;                                                    |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : rNP=randNicePencil(kk,g);                               |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : M=cliffordModule(rNP.matFact1,rNP.matFact2,rNP.baseRing)|
|                                                             |
|o5 = CliffordModule{...6...}                                 |
|                                                             |
|o5 : CliffordModule                                          |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : f=M.hyperellipticBranchEquation                         |
|                                                             |
|          3       2 2        3      4                        |
|o6 = - 12s t - 50s t  - 16s*t  + 47t                         |
|                                                             |
|o6 : kk[s, t]                                                |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : sM=M.symmetricM                                         |
|                                                             |
|o7 = | -5t  -50s 6t     -6t  |                               |
|     | -50s 0    -9t    5t   |                               |
|     | 6t   -9t  -s-30t 3t   |                               |
|     | -6t  5t   3t     -48t |                               |
|                                                             |
|                      4               4                      |
|o7 : Matrix (kk[s, t])  <-- (kk[s, t])                       |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : f == det sM                                             |
|                                                             |
|o8 = true                                                    |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+

