preRandomLineBundle -- a random line bundle on the hyperelliptic curve
**********************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        L=preRandomLineBundle(f)
        Ld=preRandomLineBundle(d,f)
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, the hyperelliptic
        branch equation of a CliffordModule.
      * d, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
  * Outputs:
      * L, an instance of the type *note VectorBundleOnE: VectorBundleOnE,, a
        line bundle on E
      * Ld, an instance of the type *note VectorBundleOnE: VectorBundleOnE,, a
        line bundle on E of degree d.

Description
===========

Chooses a random line bundle on the hyperelliptic curve E of genus g given by
the equation y^2-(-1)^{g}*f, where f is the branch equation of degree (2g+2).
Input with an integer d gives a random line bundle of degree d on E.

Note that a line bundle on E is given by the y-action which is represented by a
traceless 2x2 matrix

b c

a -b

whose determinant equals to (-1)^{g}*f. We find such a matrix over a finite
ground field by picking randomly b, a homogeneous form of degree (g+1), since
the binary form b^2 + (-1)^{g}*f frequently factors.



+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : kk=ZZ/101;                                                |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : setRandomSeed 0                                           |
| -- setting random seed to 0                                   |
|                                                               |
|o2 = 0                                                         |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : g=1;                                                      |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : rNP=randNicePencil(kk,g);                                 |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : cM=cliffordModule(rNP.matFact1,rNP.matFact2,rNP.baseRing);|
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : f=cM.hyperellipticBranchEquation                          |
|                                                               |
|          3       2 2        3      4                          |
|o6 = - 12s t - 50s t  - 16s*t  + 47t                           |
|                                                               |
|o6 : kk[s, t]                                                  |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : L=preRandomLineBundle(f)                                  |
|                                                               |
|o7 = VectorBundleOnE{...1...}                                  |
|                                                               |
|o7 : VectorBundleOnE                                           |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : degOnE L                                                  |
|                                                               |
|o8 = -1                                                        |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : m=L.yAction                                               |
|                                                               |
|o9 = {-2} | 39s2+21st+34t2 44s3-34s2t+7st2+2t3 |               |
|     {-1} | 32s+t          -39s2-21st-34t2     |               |
|                                                               |
|                      2               2                        |
|o9 : Matrix (kk[s, t])  <-- (kk[s, t])                         |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : (m)^2_(0,0)+(-1)^g*f==0                                  |
|                                                               |
|o10 = true                                                     |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i11 : L0=preRandomLineBundle(0,f)                              |
|                                                               |
|o11 = VectorBundleOnE{...1...}                                 |
|                                                               |
|o11 : VectorBundleOnE                                          |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i12 : degOnE L0                                                |
|                                                               |
|o12 = 0                                                        |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+
|i13 : orderInPic L0                                            |
|                                                               |
|o13 = 37                                                       |
+---------------------------------------------------------------+

Caveat
======

The ground field kk has to be finite.

See also
========

  * *note vectorBundleOnE: vectorBundleOnE, -- creates a VectorBundleOnE,
    represented as a matrix factorization
  * *note VectorBundleOnE: VectorBundleOnE, -- vector bundle on a hyperelliptic
    curve E
  * *note degOnE: degOnE, -- degree of a vector bundle on E
  * *note orderInPic: orderInPic, -- order of a line bundle of degree 0 in
    Pic(E)
  * *note randomLineBundle: randomLineBundle, -- a random balanced line bundle
    on the hyperelliptic curve

