+------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : L = randomLineBundle(0,f);                                         |
+------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i10 : L.yAction                                                         |
|                                                                        |
|o10 = {-1} | -18s2-13st-43t2 13s2+45st-16t2 |                           |
