translateIsotropicSubspace -- choose a random isotropic subspace
****************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        uL=translateIsotropicSubspace(M,L,S)
  * Inputs:
      * M, an instance of the type *note CliffordModule: CliffordModule,,
        corresponding to a maximal isotropic subspace u
      * L, an instance of the type *note VectorBundleOnE: VectorBundleOnE,, a
        degree 0 line bundle on the associated hyperelliptic curve E of genus
        g.
      * S, a *note polynomial ring: (Macaulay2Doc)PolynomialRing,, a polynomial
        ring kk[x_0..y_{(g-1)},z_0,z_1,s,t] in (2g+4) variables
  * Outputs:
      * uL, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, a matrix presenting a
        maximal isotropic subspace u translated by L

Description
===========

Reid's theorem says that the set of maximal isotropic subspaces on a complete
intersection of two quadrics in (2g+2) variables is isomorphic to the set of
degree 0 line bundles on the associated hyperelliptic curve E of genus g. The
method computes the maximal isotropic subspace uL corresponding to the
translation of u by L.

+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : kk=ZZ/101;                                                   |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : setRandomSeed 0                                              |
| -- setting random seed to 0                                      |
|                                                                  |
|o2 = 0                                                            |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : g=2;                                                         |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : (S,qq,R,u, M1,M2, Mu1,Mu2) = randomNicePencil(kk,g);         |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : M=cliffordModule (Mu1, Mu2, R);                              |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : f=M.hyperellipticBranchEquation                              |
|                                                                  |
|        5      4 2      3 3      2 4        5      6              |
|o6 = 15s t + 6s t  + 33s t  + 30s t  - 48s*t  + 14t               |
|                                                                  |
|o6 : R                                                            |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : L=randomLineBundle(0,f);                                     |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : uL=translateIsotropicSubspace(M,L,S)                         |
|                                                                  |
|o8 = | y_1+28z_1+48z_2 y_0+16z_1-21z_2 x_1-18z_1+25z_2 x_0-15z_2 ||
|                                                                  |
|             1      4                                             |
|o8 : Matrix S  <-- S                                              |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : assert (betti uL == betti u)                                 |
+------------------------------------------------------------------+

